---
// Schematic rail map of the trip: wide on desktop, north-up and tall on phones.
---
<figure class="b-map b-wide">
  <svg class="map-h" viewBox="0 0 900 412" role="img" aria-label="Schematic rail map: Milano to Roma by Italo, Firenze, then Milano, Domodossola and Brig to Interlaken, and back to Milano">
    <path class="it" d="M440 150 L640 270 L810 345" fill="none" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    <path class="ch" d="M440 150 L330 150 L240 110 L120 110" fill="none" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    <path class="ch" d="M120 110 L62 60 M120 110 L80 190 M120 110 L190 62" fill="none" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="2 10" />
    <g class="stn" stroke-width="4"><circle cx="440" cy="150" r="13" /><circle cx="640" cy="270" r="10" /><circle cx="810" cy="345" r="13" /><circle cx="330" cy="150" r="8" /><circle cx="240" cy="110" r="8" /><circle cx="120" cy="110" r="13" /></g>
    <g class="spur"><circle cx="62" cy="60" r="7" /><circle cx="80" cy="190" r="7" /><circle cx="190" cy="62" r="7" /></g>
    <text class="city" x="456" y="134">Milano</text><text class="dim" x="456" y="112">Days 1 · 5 · 9 · 10</text>
    <text class="city" x="626" y="302" text-anchor="end">Firenze</text><text class="dim" x="626" y="320" text-anchor="end">Day 4</text>
    <text class="city" x="792" y="384" text-anchor="end">Roma</text><text class="dim" x="792" y="402" text-anchor="end">Days 1 to 3</text>
    <text x="330" y="130" class="dim" text-anchor="middle">Domodossola</text><text x="226" y="96" class="dim">Brig</text>
    <text class="city" x="134" y="146">Interlaken</text><text class="dim" x="134" y="164">Days 5 to 9</text>
    <text class="dim" x="74" y="46">Schilthorn · 6</text><text class="dim" x="196" y="52">Grindelwald · 7</text><text class="dim" x="92" y="214">Lauterbrunnen · 7</text>
    <text class="dim" x="540" y="196" transform="rotate(31 540 196)">Italo · 250 km/h</text>
    <text class="dim" x="285" y="182" text-anchor="middle">late train · Day 5</text>
  </svg>
  <svg class="map-v" viewBox="0 0 340 510" role="img" aria-label="Schematic rail map, north at the top: Interlaken, Brig, Domodossola, Milano, Firenze, Roma">
    <path class="it" d="M150 255 L130 370 L160 470" fill="none" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    <path class="ch" d="M70 70 L110 150 L130 200 L150 255" fill="none" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    <path class="ch" d="M70 70 L30 32 M70 70 L112 28 M70 70 L26 118" fill="none" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="2 9" />
    <g class="stn" stroke-width="3.5"><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="12" /><circle cx="110" cy="150" r="7" /><circle cx="130" cy="200" r="7" /><circle cx="150" cy="255" r="12" /><circle cx="130" cy="370" r="9" /><circle cx="160" cy="470" r="12" /></g>
    <g class="spur"><circle cx="30" cy="32" r="6" /><circle cx="112" cy="28" r="6" /><circle cx="26" cy="118" r="6" /></g>
    <text class="city" x="90" y="76">Interlaken</text><text class="dim" x="90" y="94">Days 5 to 9</text>
    <text class="dim" x="10" y="16">Schilthorn · 6</text><text class="dim" x="124" y="24">Grindelwald · 7</text><text class="dim" x="6" y="142">Lauterbrunnen · 7</text>
    <text x="126" y="155" class="dim">Brig</text><text x="146" y="205" class="dim">Domodossola</text>
    <text class="dim" x="196" y="232">late train · Day 5</text>
    <text class="city" x="172" y="261">Milano</text><text class="dim" x="172" y="279">Days 1 · 5 · 9 · 10</text>
    <text class="dim" x="160" y="318">Italo · 250 km/h</text>
    <text class="city" x="152" y="376">Firenze</text><text class="dim" x="152" y="394">Day 4</text>
    <text class="city" x="182" y="476">Roma</text><text class="dim" x="182" y="494">Days 1 to 3</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption><span class="mono">The route</span>No rental car. If it had rails, a cable or a propeller, we rode it.</figcaption>
</figure>
